      "name": "China Lake Grenade Launcher",
      "slug": "china-lake-grenade-launcher",
      "teaser": "Introduces China Lake to Tarkov",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2573.png",
      "downloads": 14874,
      "favourites_count": 0,
      "description": "<p><em><strong>Chunky, Heavy and definitely will take a lot of your hideout space</strong></em></p>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Description</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>A legendary and well known weapon made during the 60s, a rare commodity made with limited numbers. The China Lake is a heavy pump action grenade launcher that can store up to 3 round (4 including the one in the chamber).</p>\n<p>Can be obtained from PMC and Scav AI (Low % of being equipped)<br />\nCan be obtained from cultist circle sacrifices (can be exchanged up to 5 times, 1 each with a <em>Specific</em> item)<br />\nRequested by Colette Blackpaw</p>\n<p>&lt;iframe width=“560” height=“315” src=“https://www.youtube.com/embed/WrJCeibTGyk?si=18-76Xhv65mj9UDE” title=“YouTube video player” frameborder=“0” allow=“accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share” referrerpolicy=“strict-origin-when-cross-origin” allowfullscreen&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;<br />\nAnimation by me<br />\nTexturing by Tron<br />\n<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/military/gun/china-lake-grenade-launcher-f7536241-8362-41b7-992d-dafc8e41ed52\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Model</a> by <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.cgtrader.com/designers/jose-mccallum\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Jose-McCallum</strong></a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Install Instruction</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>1. Download the Zip from the Gdrive</p>\n<p>2. Open the Zip</p>\n<p>3. Copy the content of the Zip your SPT folder</p>\n<p>4. Enjoy<br />\n<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/wMIskD3.gif\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wMIskD3.gif\" alt=\"wMIskD3.gif\" /></a></p></div></div></div>\n<p><em>P.S Leaf sight no worky, darn thing ain’t adjusting like a UBGL sight</em></p>\n",
